{"id":55219,"date":"2026-07-28T14:14:19","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T13:14:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55219"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:03","slug":"corrida-solidariedade-apav","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-solidariedade-apav\/","title":{"rendered":"20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um evento desportivo e solid\u00e1rio emblem\u00e1tico organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Apoio \u00e0 V\u00edtima (APAV)<\/strong>. Celebrando duas d\u00e9cadas de compromisso c\u00edvico e desportivo no pulm\u00e3o verde da capital, a iniciativa mobiliza corredores e fam\u00edlias no Parque Florestal de Monsanto para apoiar a nobre miss\u00e3o de assist\u00eancia gratuita e confidencial a v\u00edtimas de crime.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento tem como epicentro o Anfiteatro Keil do Amaral e disponibiliza a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico com trof\u00e9us para a geral e escal\u00f5es), a participativa <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Kids Race de 600 m<\/strong> para os mais novos. O percurso ondulado desenrola-se por alcatr\u00e3o e estrad\u00f5es em Monsanto, oferecendo abastecimentos, dorsal personalizado, medalha de finalista, bengaleiro e op\u00e7\u00e3o de aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px