 -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio da 20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, no Parque Florestal de Monsanto, Lisboa. A Kids Race parte \u00e0s 09:30, a Corrida de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 10:00 e a Caminhada de 5 km inicia-se \u00e0s 10:05.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica situado o local de partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, secretariado, partida e meta localizam-se na Alameda Keil do Amaral, no Parque Florestal de Monsanto em Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es variam por fases: a Corrida de 10 km situa-se entre 10,00 \u20ac e 16,00 \u20ac (20,00 \u20ac em \u00faltima hora), a Caminhada de 5 km entre 8,00 \u20ac e 14,00 \u20ac, e a Kids Race entre 3,00 \u20ac e 7,00 \u20ac. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online encerram a 21 de outubro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento do kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit pode ser levantado no secretariado t\u00e9cnico na quinta e sexta-feira anteriores ao evento, ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova entre as 08:00 e as 09:00 no local de partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que apoios e servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado, chip eletr\u00f3nico (na corrida de 10 km), medalha de finalista, abastecimentos, seguro desportivo e servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro na zona de partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanc